    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned that Transcript A sounds like they might have \"practiced\" their testimony because it's so polished. Do you think the informal style in Transcript B makes them seem like they're lying or just less educated? I'm trying to figure out if a jury would view their lack of formal grammar as a sign that they aren't being honest about what actually happened.",
